{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Scam Line \u2014 a party game for 4\u20138 players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/c547de02afddd0a300774c090fd460b8.poster.avif?t=1771234699\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/c547de02afddd0a300774c090fd460b8.webm?t=1771234699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/c547de02afddd0a300774c090fd460b8.mp4?t=1771234699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Only One Will Win</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are locked in a room. You cannot see the others. You can only talk through an old mobile phone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust is optional. Survival is not.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scam Line is a multiplayer social game for 4 to 8 players where you compete in psychological and social challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All players are placed in separate rooms. Communication is limited. Information is power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/1ae3e52c1b82a3a3b6ededcad9ba68b6.poster.avif?t=1771234699\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/1ae3e52c1b82a3a3b6ededcad9ba68b6.webm?t=1771234699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/1ae3e52c1b82a3a3b6ededcad9ba68b6.mp4?t=1771234699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In Early Access, the game features 12 social challenges, including:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Learn your neighbours\u2019 room numbers before anyone else</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Identify who is dressed differently</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Play the classic Prisoner\u2019s Dilemma</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 And many more\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every challenge tests how well you can read people \u2014 and how well you can lie to them.<strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no right choices. Only consequences:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Form alliances</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Make deals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Share information</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or choose a darker path:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Bluff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Lie</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Manipulate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the end, only one of you will win.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/57111ef862dfe5a29adf8c6e3e68888d.poster.avif?t=1771234699\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/57111ef862dfe5a29adf8c6e3e68888d.webm?t=1771234699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/extras/57111ef862dfe5a29adf8c6e3e68888d.mp4?t=1771234699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social deception 4-8 players gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice-based communication</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological mind games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unpredictable player behavior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple visuals, strong atmosphere</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAQ</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How much does the game cost? </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the price of a cup of coffee.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New social multiplayer games release every day \u2014 why this one? </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scam Line focuses on deception, timing, and environmental surprises to create a truly unique social experience. You are an architect of your gaming experience. Based on your behaviour every run may become a unique adventure. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will it run on a potato PC? </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are there bugs? </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2794590?t=1771234699","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/1f7deb68e6d3b3a76f244934a6a204dee198d0df/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771234699","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/81ed1f45b16ae945a706a8c2ad751f75284fde45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771234699","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794590/81ed1f45b16ae945a706a8c2ad751f75284fde45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771234699","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Scam Line \u2014 a party game for 4\u201